{
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "links": [],
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Total requests",
      "description": "Chat requests handled by the agent.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(agent_requests_total)",
          "legendFormat": "requests"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "short", "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Error rate",
      "description": "Share of requests that returned an error.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(agent_requests_total{agent_status=\"error\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(agent_requests_total[$__rate_interval])), 0.000001)",
          "legendFormat": "error rate"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "percentunit", "min": 0, "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.05 }] } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "LLM latency p95",
      "description": "95th percentile duration of LLM calls.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(agent_llm_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "unit": "s", "color": { "mode": "thresholds" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "orange", "value": 5 }, { "color": "red", "value": 15 }] } },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false }, "colorMode": "value", "graphMode": "area", "textMode": "auto" }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request rate by status",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (agent_status) (rate(agent_requests_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{agent_status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "reqps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "LLM latency quantiles",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 5 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le) (rate(agent_llm_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(agent_llm_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum by (le) (rate(agent_llm_duration_seconds_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 10, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Token usage rate by type",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (token_type) (rate(agent_tokens_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{token_type}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never", "stacking": { "mode": "normal" } } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tool calls by tool",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 13 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (gen_ai_tool_name) (rate(agent_tool_calls_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{gen_ai_tool_name}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "fillOpacity": 15, "lineWidth": 2, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } }
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Traces",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 21 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Distributed traces\n\nTraces are stored in **Tempo**. Open **Explore** (`/explore`), pick the **Tempo** datasource and run a TraceQL query, for example:\n\n```\n{ resource.service.name = \"agent-demo\" }\n```\n\nEach agent turn produces an `invoke_agent agent-demo` span containing `chat <model>` and `execute_tool <name>` child spans. Click a span to see the LLM prompt/completion token counts and tool arguments."
      }
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "10s",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "tags": ["agent-demo", "opentelemetry"],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "agent-demo Observability",
  "uid": "agent-demo-obs",
  "version": 1
}
